      "designInstructions": "# Visual Identity\nThe Clutch Co design system is a \"High-Octane\" financial aesthetic. It combines deep Pitch Black backgrounds with vibrant Bright Gold and Lime Flash accents to create a high-performance, premium trading atmosphere.\n\n# Layout Signatures\n- **Mobile-First Responsiveness**: All layouts are centered on a max-width container (e.g., 480px for mobile focus) to ensure consistency across phone, tablet, and PC.\n- **Glassmorphism**: Components use frosted glass effects (`backdrop-blur-md`) with subtle semi-transparent borders to create depth on dark backgrounds.\n- **Card-Based Hierarchy**: Information is grouped into rounded cards (`bg-surface`) with generous internal padding.\n\n# Header & Navigation\n- **Fixed Universal Header**: A backdrop-blurred top bar containing the \"C\" logo (Yellow-filled cog/circle), the company name \"THE CLUTCH CO\" in bold capital letters, and a profile avatar on the right.\n- **Fixed Bottom Navigation**: A three-tab persistent bar for \"Home\", \"Task\", and \"Records\". Active states are highlighted in Bright Gold with a subtle glow effect.\n\n# Typography & Color Usage\n- **Primary Color (Bright Gold)**: Reserved for CTAs, active states, and branding.\n- **Secondary Color (Lime Flash)**: Used exclusively for profit indicators, success messages, and growth metrics.\n- **Tabular Data**: Financial figures use IBM Plex Sans for maximum readability and alignment.\n\n# Decorative Elements\n- **Glowing Accents**: Subtle box-shadows with low opacity color match the primary/secondary tokens to simulate a \"cockpit\" instrument feel.\n- **Minimal Borders**: 1px borders in semi-transparent white or muted gold to define boundaries without clutter.",
      "created": "2026-06-02T18:57:42.409745+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-06-02T18:57:42.409745+00:00"
